id: spirit-sword
name: Spirit Sword
uaType: both
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score of 8+
tpCost: 15
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerTier: 3
requiresTarget: true
# "Use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. You must select the Simple (Physical) Profile" - asked
# with "either the Slashing or Piercing Weapon Category" (lent as a Weapon Category is, no Weapon asked) and "increase
# your Melee Range by up to 1(bT) Squares ... OR apply a Cone or Sphere AoE"; through a Health Threshold, Staggered to the
# start of your next turn (chat.mjs askSpiritSword, postSpiritSword, spiritSwordLanded).
spiritSword: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Basic Attack out of sequence, Simple (Physical), Slashing or Piercing, with up to 1(bT) more Melee Range or a Cone or
  Sphere; through a Health Threshold, Staggered until the start of your next turn.
text: >
  Spirit Sword: Creating a shining sword of energy, you unleash a physical blow without having to place yourself in your
  enemy’s attack range.
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score of 8+
  –TP Cost: 15
  –KP Cost: 3(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. You must select the Simple (Physical) Profile for
  this Attacking Maneuver and it gains the following effects:

  * Apply the effects of either the Slashing or Piercing Weapon Category to that Attacking Maneuver (decided upon making
  the Attacking Maneuver).
  * You may increase your Melee Range by up to 1(bT) Squares for the duration of this Attacking Maneuver, OR apply a Cone
  or Sphere AoE to that Attacking Maneuver.
  * If you knock an Opponent through a Health Threshold with this Attacking Maneuver, they gain the Staggered Combat
  Condition until the start of your next turn.
